// Cursor Rules for TAHSEEN (Flutter, Adaptive & Personalized Arabic Learning Platform)
//
// 1. Stack & Architecture
//    - Flutter (Dart), feature-first structure.
//    - Riverpod for state management.
//    - go_router for navigation.
//    - freezed & json_serializable for all models (with from/toJson).
//    - dio for HTTP, drift or hive for local storage.
//    - Clean architecture: domain/data/presentation layers.
//    - All code must be null-safe, SOLID, and testable.
//
// 2. Domain & Features
//    - CEFR A1–C2, 4 skills: Listening (الاستماع), Speaking (الكلام), Reading (القراءة), Writing (الكتابة).
//    - Core features: Onboarding, Pre-test adaptif (IRT/CAT), AI Planner (مسار التعلم), Materi adaptif, Latihan adaptif per-skill, Feedback AI Tutor, Remedial, Post-test, Sertifikat, Unlocking system.
//    - All learning modules use Arabic only (no transliteration).
//
// 3. UX & Localization
//    - Bahasa Indonesia as default UI language, ready for i18n.
//    - Basic accessibility: scalable fonts, semantic widgets.
//
// 4. File Structure (always create):
//    - lib/core/
//    - lib/features/onboarding/
//    - lib/features/assessment/
//    - lib/features/assessment/engine/irt.dart
//    - lib/features/assessment/engine/item_bank.dart
//    - lib/features/assessment/engine/session.dart
//    - lib/features/ai/ai_client.dart
//    - lib/features/ai/ai_planner.dart
//    - lib/features/ai/ai_tutor.dart
//    - lib/features/learning/modules/
//    - lib/features/learning/paths/
//
// 5. Coding Conventions
//    - Separate UI (widgets) from logic (notifiers/providers/services).
//    - All models: use freezed, include from/toJson.
//    - Provide unit tests & basic widget tests for critical flows.
//    - Use strongly typed Dart everywhere.
//
// 6. When requirements are unclear:
//    - Ask for clarification and propose options/assumptions before implementation.
//
// 7. Custom Rule
//    - Semua modul pembelajaran menggunakan bahasa Arab saja, tanpa transliterasi.
//
// End of Cursor Rules
